      "payload": {
        "progress": "Unit was already reconciled to chars everywhere in live code (show --context migrated to renderContextPackWithBudget earlier); fixed the stale docs still claiming a token-estimate inconsistency and removed the now-dead budgetCharsFromTokens helper. Added shared parseBudgetOption (shared.ts) rejecting negative --budget consistently across ready/search/status/events/show/context (context's old local parser is now an alias). Also fixed a pre-existing tiny-budget overshoot bug in renderContextPack's truncation note. Full verification suite green."
